error[E0401]: `Proc` needs the type its `join` collects
 --> mem:///main.lu:1:13
  |
1 | fn watch(p: Proc) -> int {
  |             ^^^^ write `Proc[T]`
  |
  = note: a proc that completes exits `normal(value)` ([conc.proc.exit]) and `p.join()` hands that
    value back ([conc.proc.join]), so the handle names its type: `Proc[int]` for a proc
    whose callee returns an `int`.
